                                        "sense_id": "f413e190-95e8-3290-b93e-f53493d47894",
                                        "entry_id": "ee7e2618-5b79-36b7-a342-cbb604ab7a16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make (something, such as an abstract idea) possible to be perceived by the senses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1aaaf91-d8e4-409a-9448-e2fc5d91dbfb",
                                                "sense_id": "f413e190-95e8-3290-b93e-f53493d47894",
                                                "text": "It was the unknown, objectified at last, in concrete flesh and blood, bending over him and reaching down to seize hold of him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8551c9a-b520-319e-b56d-150341cc95f5",
                                        "entry_id": "ee7e2618-5b79-36b7-a342-cbb604ab7a16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To treat (something) as objectively real."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "948a536b-5b97-4778-ab65-9434119d11ec",
                                                "sense_id": "a8551c9a-b520-319e-b56d-150341cc95f5",
                                                "text": "The mystic objectifies a rich feeling in the pit of the stomach into a cosmology."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20002c94-79b8-3a9b-8ced-7e4ad677d2b0",
                                        "entry_id": "ee7e2618-5b79-36b7-a342-cbb604ab7a16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To treat (someone) as a mere (often sexual) object, denying their dignity and tending toward dehumanizing them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b500a72f-a22f-4a6c-b62f-11cdde7aee3c",
                                                "sense_id": "20002c94-79b8-3a9b-8ced-7e4ad677d2b0",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: demean"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd74cc4d-0ddb-4182-9aaa-fca811681a47",
                                                "sense_id": "20002c94-79b8-3a9b-8ced-7e4ad677d2b0",
                                                "text": "1994 \"Book review: Fire With Fire\", backlash.comhttp://www.backlash.com/content/gender/1996/3-mar96/page23.html\nShe talks about the fact that women objectify men just as much as men objectify women, and she even admits her culpability in doing so by talking about how sometimes she wishes she had a group of \"nubile 17 year old soccer players\" to keep her happy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7512b24-3def-40df-98b9-e5be7f9e5646",
                                                "sense_id": "20002c94-79b8-3a9b-8ced-7e4ad677d2b0",
                                                "text": "The entire notion of cheerleading is just a sexist attempt to try to objectify the female body."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
